        "created_at": "2026-05-14T20:06:16.390Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a suspicion that they might rely on the other existing social platforms like Discord for the community engagement. That was kind of de facto where things moved some time before the FRG purchase. With a small team of five, forum management might be an extra load to handle.</p>",
