        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-05-14T20:13:27.808Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe, but as far as I’m aware a Discord server needs mods just as much as a forum.<br>\nPlus, unless they make a new one, there’s no official, free Sentinels or GTG discord that I’m aware of. There’s the Letters Page one, but I believe you’ve gotta subscribe to the PatrAeon for that, and there’s the Realm of Discord one, but that’s not officially affiliated with them.<br>\nI guess they could just continue relying on an unofficial public discord and an official paid one, but that seems like an odd arrangement to me.</p>",
