        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-05-15T03:57:08.119Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You’ve just cited the primary reasons I do not and will not engage with Discord.  Utterly useless format for people who don’t want to compulsively check up every few hours, and terrible at preserving past conversations so they can be revisited.</p>\n<p>This forum is mostly dead, sure, but it’s still a valuable record of the past.</p>",
