        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-05-15T15:32:18.861Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I mean, yeah, pretty much. Discord is the modern successor to IRC, not to forums. It’s meant to be a chat room that you can occasionally save details in, not a place to store content.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I’m not sure there’s a workaround for that. Forum culture has largely been eaten. There’s chatrooms, there are wikis, and then there’s Reddit-style information searching (which is also on the decline.) The few forums I’m still involved in are all in slow decline, without many new folks arriving to replace the slow drain of older members.</p>",
