        "created_at": "2026-05-18T19:49:58.997Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They said on the livestream that there will be a new way to manage playtesting that will certainly involve Discord, but didn’t elaborate. I 100% agree that Discord is a terrible format for organizing information in the way that playtesting requires. Querki is perfectly designed for it, forums are adequate. It’s not that hard to roll off-the-shelf forum software; we’ll see what Christopher and Matt K. decide to do. Or, the playtesters will, anyway.</p>",
